  "answer": "This has been reported before. When Light Switch changes the theme while Task Manager is already open, Task Manager ends up with a mix of light and dark elements. Maintainers closed the other reports as duplicates of PowerToys#42463, so follow that ticket for a fix. The archived tickets don't give a confirmed fix. One commenter on the related ticket PowerToys#44259 said restarting the taskbar cleared a similar mixed-theme glitch. For Task Manager, closing and reopening it after a theme change should also give you the correct colours."
